own":[9.5,9.5],"ailment":"击飞"}}],"number":1}],"profile":{"Age":[21],"Height":[158],"Weight":[47]},"tribes":["半精灵"],"story":"红斗篷埃尔韦拉，想成为黑帮团伙“水库蟒蛇”领导人的最年轻组员。\n\n埃尔韦拉的奶奶从堪称地狱的“狼腹”脱险后，变成战斗家并成立了“水库蟒蛇”。这个犯罪团伙主要以武器走私为生，不仅如此，只要能赚钱，他们无所不作。埃尔韦拉是一名任劳任怨的组员，也是备受瞩目的领导候选人。为了不得罪严厉可怕的奶奶并得到她的认可，埃尔韦拉认真狩猎怪物与悬赏犯人，尽心尽责完成组织下达的任务。身为组员，埃尔韦拉深知失败即意味着被组织除名，况且，被除名组员的下场谁都不得而知。因此，埃尔韦拉每次都会全力以赴迎战。\n\n如今，埃尔韦拉的篮子里装的不再是为身体抱恙的奶奶准备的食物，而是各种炸弹与枪支。如果不确定里面有什么，最好不要去掀开盖子。","storyKey":"profile_redhood_story","sources":{"hero":"heroes.json / OriginId=12","profile":"heroprofile.json / OriginId=12","strings":"strings-zhCN.json","items":"items.json / TargetCharacterIds, ExclusiveCharacterId","voiceLines":["strings-zhCN.json / Voice_*, cv_*","strings-enUS.json / Voice_*, cv_*","strings-jaJP.json / Voice_*, cv_*"],"voiceAudio":"gtaudio/data/offline-package.json; CharacterVoiceType; heroes.json VoiceId"},"voiceLines":[{"id":"redhood","label":"普通","lines":[{"type":"NormalBattleWin","label":"胜利-普通战斗","texts":{"zhCN":["别站在我身后。"],"enUS":["Another win for the Hood!"],"jaJP":["アタイの後ろに立つなよ"]},"keys":["cv_redhood_NormalBattleWin"],"audio":{"zhCN":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_cn/12/120001@4986330289576003806"],"enUS":["cdn/Android/ondemand/voices_en/12/120001"],"jaJP":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_ja/12/120001@-7188816948025947027"]},"audioName":"120001"},{"type":"BossBattleWin","label":"胜利-首领战斗","texts":{"zhCN":["好吧！来呀！"],"enUS":["The Big Red won!"],"jaJP":["オッケー！かかってきやがれっ！"]},"keys":["cv_redhood_BossBattleWin"],"audio":{"zhCN":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_cn/12/120002@1656351746481365765"],"enUS":["cdn/Android/ondemand/voices_en/12/120002"],"jaJP":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_ja/12/120002@-526371323161229158"]},"audioName":"120002"},{"type":"Die","label":"阵亡","texts":{"zhCN":["呃，奶奶…"],"enUS":["Grandma…"],"jaJP":["お祖母様…"]},"keys":["cv_redhood_Die"],"audio":{"zhCN":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_cn/12/120003@2339009905663205741"],"enUS":["c